{
  "$comment": "AEP-0002 \u00a74 registered core types for 0.1. status: mandatory|optional|reserved. scope: session|agent|command. schema: payload schema file under schemas/types/, or null when the payload is deferred/free-form. Machine source of truth for codegen and aep validate.",
